  "why": "The Frontier Lord Begins with Zero Subjects is a 12 episode summer 2026 run of the Ryoumin 0-Nin Start no Henkyou Ryoushu-sama adaptation, airing weekly from early July 2026 with anilist giving an end of 2026-09-18 and the last listed episode still to come. anizip:19484 is the same run: it carries SAME_AS ids to both anilist:196218 and mal:62078, lists the same 12 episodes, and its episode titles are the run's own. cr:GT00378124-GS00378135 is the same run: it carries SAME_AS ids to all five members, and its 11 listed episodes are the run's first 11 by title with none past the run's end. jw:489011-515837 is the same run: it carries SAME_AS ids to all five members and to anizip:19484, and its 11 episode titles match the run's one for one. cr:GT00378124 is the bare Crunchyroll series container for the same show, with no dates and no episodes of its own, so it holds the run rather than being it. Episodes 1 to 11 are paired between anizip, Crunchyroll and JustWatch on exact, distinctive titles in the same order (for example \"The Frontier Lord and the Strange Merchant\" at 3 and \"The Frontier Lord and the Wedding\" at 9); the anizip and Crunchyroll dates are a week apart throughout, matching the catalogues' own disagreement about the start date (2026-07-03 on anilist and kitsu, 2026-07-10 on mal), so the pairing rests on the titles. anizip's episode 12 and kitsu's 12 bare numbered episodes are paired with nothing: episode 12 has no title anywhere and the kitsu rows carry neither titles nor dates."
